# Community translation files (one per locale; only the active one builds
# entries). Loaded by EllesmereUI_Locale.lua at the parent's ADDON_LOADED
# whenever the effective locale is non-English -- English clients never pay
# the parse. To add a language: create <code>.lua here and add one line
# below. See CONTRIBUTING_TRANSLATIONS.md in the parent addon.
deDE.lua
esES.lua
esMX.lua
frFR.lua
itIT.lua
koKR.lua
ptBR.lua
ruRU.lua
zhCN.lua
zhTW.lua
